;
Method, Part 1, Chebychev polynomial (Watkin, 1994; Prince,
1982)
[weight] = 1.0/[A~0~*T~0~(x)+A~1~*T~1~(x) ... +A~n-1~]*T~n-1~(x)],
where A~i~ are the Chebychev coefficients listed below and x = Fcalc/Fmax
A~i~ are: 0.275 0.396E-01 0.219E-01.
Part 2 robust weighting (Prince, 1982)
W = [weight]*[1-(\dF/6*\sF)^2^]^2^
;
